OL,3,GNEWSAFraud-accused Southern Water boss
OL,4,Aappears in court
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former chief executive of Southern
OL,7,FWater has appeared in court charged
OL,8,Fwith conspiracy to defraud, over
OL,9,Fallegations water quality tests were
OL,10,Fmanipulated to avoid penalties.
OL,12,FMatthew Wright, 60, who denies any
OL,13,Fwrongdoing, appeared at Bromley
OL,14,FMagistrates' Court on Friday alongside
OL,15,Fthree other former employees.
OL,17,FWright, along with Philip Barker, 57,
OL,18,FClive Massey, 64, and Mark Gregory, 63,
OL,19,Fare accused of conspiracy to defraud
OL,20,Fthe Environment Agency and water
OL,21,Fregulator Ofwat.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,336,330,200,160,0,100
