OL,3,GNEWSAFraud-accused Southern Water boss
OL,4,Aappears in court
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is alleged that between January 2012
OL,7,Fand December 2017, the group
OL,8,Fmanipulated a self-monitoring regime by
OL,9,Fcarrying out artificial "no-flow
OL,10,Fevents" at wastewater treatment works,
OL,11,Fto avoid failing environmental checks.
